  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0-beta.2 wrapping ZVec C++ 0.5.1. Consumer smoke treats create/open success as green even if native teardown SIGSEGVs on linux-x64. Shipped natives: win-x64, linux-x64, osx-arm64, android-arm64, android-x64. Not yet: win-arm64, linux-arm64, osx-x64, ios-arm64, iossimulator-arm64, maccatalyst-arm64 — blocked by cross-building zvec bundled third parties (Arrow, FastPFOR/SIMDe, Lz4, host protoc); ships when CI is hard-green and pack always includes the RID. See README Native RIDs.",
